<%- include('partials/header') %>
<!-- Hero Image Banner -->
    <header class="relative w-full h-[50vh] min-h-[400px] pt-20 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/static/hero_images/crowd_praying.jpg')] bg-cover bg-center"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/80 via-white/70 to-[#FAFAFA] dark:from-[#0b1437]/90 dark:via-[#0b1437]/80 dark:to-[#0b1437]"></div>
        
        <div class="relative z-10 text-center px-6">
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4 tracking-tight drop-shadow-lg">
                <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.heroTitle') : 'New Life Starts Here.' %>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto drop-shadow-md">
                <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.heroSubtitle') : 'Real Grace for Real Life.' %>
            </p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Overlapping Hero -->
    <main class="flex-1 max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full px-6 py-8 -mt-16 relative z-20 macos-glass mb-12">
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
            <span class="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-white/10 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1">
                <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('common.readTime', { min: '2' }) : '2 MIN READ' %>
            </span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-white/10 pb-6">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
                <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.title') : 'Salvation' %>
            </h2>
            <div class="w-24 h-1 rounded-full opacity-80" style="background-color: #0075ff"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="prose max-w-none">
            <div class="mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-3">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 opacity-70" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section1.title') : 'The Problem: Sin & Separation' %>
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section1.p1') : "Here's the truth nobody posts about: something is off, and you can feel it. You've checked every box — the degree, the relationship, the career momentum — and there's still a hollow ache underneath it all. That restlessness isn't random." %>
                </p>
                <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border-l-4 my-6" style="border-color: currentColor">
                    <p class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed italic">
                        <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section1.q1') : 'The Bible names it clearly: "For all have sinned and fall short of the glory of God" (Romans 3:23). We were created for deep, unbroken relationship with our Creator, but sin — our decision to live as our own god — severed that connection at its root.' %>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border-l-4 my-6" style="border-color: currentColor">
                    <p class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed italic">
                        <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section1.q2') : 'Sin isn\'t just the "big stuff" we tend to think of. It\'s the quiet self-centeredness, the anxiety that comes from carrying a weight you were never designed to hold, the emptiness that no playlist, relationship, or achievement can fill. Romans 6:23 puts the cost plainly: "The wages of sin is death." Not just physical death — spiritual separation from the God who made you and loves you.' %>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section1.p2') : 'That void you feel at 2 a.m. when the noise stops? That\'s the distance between your soul and the One it was made for. And no amount of self-improvement, therapy hacks, or curated living can bridge it on its own.' %>
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-3">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 opacity-70" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section2.title') : 'The Solution: Jesus Christ' %>
                </h3>
                <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border-l-4 my-6" style="border-color: currentColor">
                    <p class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed italic">
                        <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section2.q1') : 'But God didn\'t look at the wreckage of humanity and walk away. He ran toward us. "For God so loved the world, that He gave His only Son, that whoever believes in Him should not perish but have eternal life" (John 3:16).' %>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section2.p1') : 'Let that land for a second: the God of the universe didn\'t send a self-help book or a set of rules — He sent Himself, in the person of Jesus Christ, to do what we could never do for ourselves.' %>
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section2.p2') : 'Jesus lived the perfect life we couldn\'t live — never once giving in to the selfishness, pride, or brokenness that defines our every day. Then He died the death we deserved, absorbing the full weight of God\'s righteous judgment against sin on the cross. And three days later, He walked out of that tomb alive, proving that sin, death, and hell have been defeated once and for all.' %>
                </p>
                <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border-l-4 my-6" style="border-color: currentColor">
                    <p class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed italic">
                        <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section2.q2') : '"But God demonstrates His own love for us in this: while we were still sinners, Christ died for us" (Romans 5:8). The cross isn\'t religion. It\'s not a moral framework.' %>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section2.p3') : 'It\'s rescue. It\'s God saying, "I\'d rather die than live without you."' %>
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-3">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 opacity-70" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section3.title') : 'The Response: Repentance & Faith' %>
                </h3>
                <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border-l-4 my-6" style="border-color: currentColor">
                    <p class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed italic">
                        <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section3.q1') : 'So how do you receive this? Salvation is not a checklist, a performance review, or something you earn by being "good enough." Scripture is crystal clear: "For by grace you have been saved through faith. And this is not your own doing; it is the gift of God, not a result of works, so that no one may boast" (Ephesians 2:8-9). It\'s a gift.' %>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section3.p1') : 'You just have to open your hands and receive it.' %>
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section3.p2') : 'Receiving it involves two things: repentance and faith. Repentance means turning — a complete 180 from running your own life to surrendering it to God. It\'s not about being perfect; it\'s about being done pretending you don\'t need Him. Faith means trusting Jesus — staking your entire life on the reality that He is Lord, Savior, and King.' %>
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mt-4 italic border-l-4 border-[#0075ff] pl-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-white/5 p-4 rounded-r-xl">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section3.prayer') : '"Jesus, I know I can\'t save myself. I\'ve been carrying the weight of my sin and my brokenness, and I\'m done trying to do life without You. I believe You died on the cross for me and rose again. I turn from my old life and I put my trust in You — as my Lord. Forgive me, change me, and lead me from this day forward. I\'m Yours. Amen."' %>
                </p>
                <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border-l-4 my-6" style="border-color: currentColor">
                    <p class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed italic">
                        <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section3.q2') : 'If you just prayed that and meant it — heaven is celebrating over you right now (Luke 15:10). This is the beginning of everything.' %>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-3">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 opacity-70" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section4.title') : 'What Happens Next' %>
                </h3>
                <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border-l-4 my-6" style="border-color: currentColor">
                    <p class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed italic">
                        <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section4.q1') : 'The second you placed your faith in Jesus, something supernatural happened. The Holy Spirit took up residence inside of you (Romans 8:9).' %>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section4.p1') : 'You now have the living presence of God within you, guiding you, comforting you, and empowering you to live a life you never could on your own strength.' %>
                </p>
                <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border-l-4 my-6" style="border-color: currentColor">
                    <p class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed italic">
                        <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section4.q2') : 'You are literally a new creation: "Therefore, if anyone is in Christ, he is a new creation. The old has passed away; behold, the new has come" (2 Corinthians 5:17).' %>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.section4.p2') : 'Your past does not define you anymore. Here is what to do next: get baptized, find a Christ-centered community, and begin reading the Word of God starting with the Gospel of John.' %>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-white/10">
            <a href="/#join" class="block w-full text-center text-white font-bold text-lg py-5 rounded-xl hover:opacity-90 transition-all shadow-lg transform hover:-translate-y-1" style="background-color: #0075ff">
                <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('salvation.ctaBtn') : "I Just Gave My Life to Jesus - What's Next?" %>
            </a>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Join Us Section -->
    <%- include('partials/join-section') %>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
